<title>USA: Negotiated muni bond sales total $412 mln Sept 18.</title>
<headline>Negotiated muni bond sales total $412 mln Sept 18.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scheduled negotiated municipal bond sales are expected to total $412 million in 10 offerings for Wednesday, according to Reuters Municipal Bond Information Group.</p>
<p>The largest issue is expected to be a $150 million Illinois Tollway Authority issue via PaineWebber Inc.</p>
<p>An additional $100 million of deals are on the Reuters possible negotiated calendar, meaning underwriters have said they may decide to price the issues depending on market conditions.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Information Group, 212-859-1826</p>
</text>
